description.content:
Sends the card production request to a kiosk machine. To confirm that card information has been successfully created, listen to the [card-production-status-change](/guides/developer/webhooks/event-types#cards-card-production-status-change) webhook with status `READY`.

{% admonition type="warning" %}
Cards that were created over 60 days ago will result in a 422 error code and cannot be retried. This is due to the data being obfuscated on our side. In this case, a new card order has to be created.
{% /admonition %}
